in kinases are operationally defined by preferential utilization of acidic proteins such as caseins as substrates and can phosphorylate many proteins.\n\nPanel/row 2:\n- Protein input: `P52341 · DUT_HHV7J (EC:3.6.1.23)`.\n- Biological source object: a protein structure rendering with red/orange/purple ribbon-like folded regions.\n- Model outputs compare descriptions of DNA repair / thymidine metabolism / dUTPase-like function.\n- Ground truth describes involvement in nucleotide metabolism, producing dUMP and preventing uracil incorporation into viral DNA.\n\nModel/interface details:\n- The `w/o Alignment` column for Llama2-7B-chat shows generic prompting text asking for structure and sequence analysis and additional protein properties.\n- The aligned Llama2-7B-chat and BioMedGPT-10B columns provide direct functional predictions.\n- The figure visually contrasts unaligned versus aligned language-model outputs and biomedical model outputs against curated ground truth protein function annotations."]}]

